<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>{{.Year}} · {{.Recipient}} · Annual sponsor report</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/sponsor-report.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/sponsor-report-paper.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/sponsor-report-annual.css"><script src="/static/js/sponsor-report.js" defer></script></head>
<body data-layout="paper" data-readonly="{{.Preview}}" class="annual-report">
{{if .Preview}}<div class="synthetic-banner">LOCAL LAYOUT DEMO · Illustrative event metrics, not actual annual results</div>{{end}}
<nav class="report-tools"><a href="/admin/reports">← Event reports</a><form method="get" action="/admin/reports/annual"><label>Year<input type="number" name="year" value="{{.Year}}" min="2020" max="2100"></label><label>Prepared for<select name="recipient"><option {{if eq .Recipient "NYDIG"}}selected{{end}}>NYDIG</option><option {{if eq .Recipient "HRF"}}selected{{end}}>HRF</option></select></label><button>Open annual draft</button></form>{{if not .Frozen}}<button type="button" id="report-edit">Edit report</button>{{end}}<button type="button" id="report-print">Print / Save as PDF</button></nav>
{{if .Message}}<p class="notice" role="status">{{.Message}}</p>{{end}}
{{if .Frozen}}<p class="notice">Frozen edition · {{.Frozen}}. Text and figures are preserved. <a href="{{.URL}}">Return to the live draft →</a></p>{{else}}
<details class="report-editor"><summary>Edit this {{.Recipient}} edition</summary><p>NYDIG and HRF have independent drafts. Save refreshes the charts. Freeze edition saves the text and collected figures together; future edits do not alter that edition. Export a PDF to preserve its visual appearance too.</p>
<form method="post" id="report-edit-form" data-save-label="Save annual draft"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{.Revision}}"><p id="report-save-status" role="status">Draft loaded.</p>
<fieldset><legend>Reporting scope</legend><label>Include events completed by<input type="date" name="cutoff" value="{{.Cutoff}}" required></label><p>The cutoff selects completed events by their local end date. Counts are current records collected when you save or freeze, not historical database values as of the cutoff. Change the cutoff and save to enable newly eligible events.</p>
{{range .Events}}<article class="annual-event-editor"><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="event" value="{{.Event.ID}}" {{if .Included}}checked{{end}} {{if not .Eligible}}disabled{{end}}>{{.Event.Location}} · {{.Event.Period}}</label><label>Hackathon coverage<select name="hack_{{.Event.ID}}"><option value="unknown" {{if eq .HackCoverage "unknown"}}selected{{end}}>Not yet reconciled / external data missing</option><option value="records" {{if eq .HackCoverage "records"}}selected{{end}}>Database records reviewed for this event</option><option value="none" {{if eq .HackCoverage "none"}}selected{{end}}>No hackathon at this event</option></select></label><a href="/{{.Event.Tag}}/admin/report">Review event report →</a></article>{{else}}<p>No published events with start dates in this year.</p>{{end}}
</fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Narrative · Markdown with live preview</legend>{{range .Sections}}<section class="narrative-editor"><label for="report-{{.Key}}">{{.Title}}</label><div class="narrative-columns"><textarea id="report-{{.Key}}" name="{{.Key}}" data-report-section="{{.Key}}" rows="10" maxlength="12000">{{.Text}}</textarea><div><div class="markdown-preview report-markdown" id="preview-{{.Key}}">{{.Markdown}}</div><p id="preview-status-{{.Key}}" class="preview-status" role="status">Preview up to date</p></div></div></section>{{end}}</fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Annual online reach</legend><p>Optional annual exports: include only the content covered by this report, explain the selection, and retain the source. Event-level exports are displayed separately below and are not automatically added together.</p>{{range .Platforms}}<h3>{{.Name}}</h3><div class="editor-grid">{{range .Metrics}}<label>{{.Label}}<input type="number" min="0" max="1000000000000" name="{{.Key}}" value="{{.Value}}" placeholder="Not supplied"></label>{{end}}<label>Source / account / export<input name="reach_{{.Key}}_source" value="{{.Source}}" maxlength="12000"></label><label>Reporting period<input name="reach_{{.Key}}_period" value="{{.Period}}" maxlength="12000"></label><label>Export date<input type="date" name="reach_{{.Key}}_date" value="{{.Date}}"></label><label>Content included / coverage<input name="reach_{{.Key}}_coverage" value="{{.Coverage}}" maxlength="12000"></label></div>{{end}}</fieldset>
<button name="action" value="save" {{if .Preview}}disabled{{end}}>Save annual draft</button> <button name="action" value="freeze" {{if .Preview}}disabled{{end}}>Save &amp; freeze edition</button>
</form>{{if .Editions}}<h3>Previously frozen editions</h3><ul>{{range .Editions}}<li><a href="{{.URL}}">{{.Date}}</a></li>{{end}}</ul>{{end}}</details>{{end}}
<main><div class="paper-edition">
<section class="paper-sheet paper-cover annual-cover"><header class="paper-masthead"><span>bitcoin++</span><span>FIELD NOTES / {{.Year}}<br>ANNUAL PARTNER EDITION</span></header><div class="paper-cover-title"><p class="paper-kicker">Completed events through {{.Cutoff}}</p><h1>A year of<br><em>building<br>together.</em></h1></div><div class="annual-orbits" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="paper-cover-bottom"><div><p class="paper-kicker">Across places. Across disciplines.</p><p>The gatherings, ideas and people<br>moving Bitcoin development forward.</p></div><div><p class="paper-kicker">Prepared for</p><p>{{.Recipient}}</p></div></div><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>{{if .Frozen}}Frozen edition{{else}}Editorial draft{{end}}</span></footer></section>
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>01 / A note from nifty</span><span>{{.Recipient}}</span></div><h2>More places.<br><em>More conversations.</em></h2><div data-section="note"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.Section "note").Markdown}}</div></div><div class="paper-facts"><article><strong>{{len .Included}}</strong><span>completed events included</span></article><article><strong>{{.UniqueSpeakers}}</strong><span>distinct program speakers</span></article></div><p class="paper-source">Speaker identities deduplicated across the included programs. Scheduled participation does not confirm attendance.</p><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Letter / {{.Recipient}}</span></footer></section>
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>02 / Across the globe</span><span>Event footprint</span></div><h2>A community<br><em>with many centres.</em></h2><svg viewBox="0 0 720 350" class="annual-globe" role="img" aria-label="Included event locations; circles sized by recorded check-ins"><image href="/static/img/report-globes.svg" width="720" height="350"/>{{range .MapPoints}}<circle cx="{{.X}}" cy="{{.Y}}" r="{{.Radius}}" fill="#f7b500" stroke="#513762" stroke-width="2"><title>{{.Name}} · {{.Tag}}</title></circle>{{end}}</svg><p class="paper-source">Approximate city centres; circle sizes reflect recorded check-ins. {{len .MapPoints}} of {{len .Included}} included events mapped. The list below includes every selected event.</p><ol class="annual-timeline">{{range .Included}}<li><strong>{{.Event.Location}}</strong><span>{{.Event.Period}}</span><a href="https://btcpp.dev/{{.Event.Tag}}">{{.Event.Title}}</a></li>{{else}}<li>No completed events selected.</li>{{end}}</ol><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Places</span></footer></section>
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>03 / Participation</span><span>People, not just totals</span></div><h2>Showing up.<br><em>Coming back.</em></h2><div data-section="community"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.Section "community").Markdown}}</div></div><div class="annual-two"><div><h3>Check-ins by event</h3>{{template "annual_bars" .AttendanceChart}}<p class="paper-source">{{.Attendances}} total event attendances. A person visiting two events contributes two attendances.</p></div><div><h3>Across the included events</h3>{{template "annual_donut" .ReturningChart}}<p class="paper-source">{{.UniqueAttendees}} distinct checked-in identities. “One event” does not mean first-ever attendance. Historical coverage and account identity changes can affect deduplication.</p></div></div><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Participation</span></footer></section>
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>04 / The program</span><span>Ideas in circulation</span></div><h2>Different formats.<br><em>Shared questions.</em></h2><div data-section="program"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.Section "program").Markdown}}</div></div><div class="annual-two"><div><h3>Program by event</h3>{{range .ProgramRows}}<div class="annual-bar-row"><div><span>{{.Name}}</span><strong>{{.Count}}</strong></div><div class="annual-stack"><i style="width:{{.TalkWidth}}%;background:#c8b3f5"></i><i style="width:{{.WorkshopWidth}}%;background:#f7b500"></i><i style="width:{{.PanelWidth}}%;background:#f6b9dc"></i></div></div>{{end}}</div><div><h3>Program mix</h3>{{template "annual_donut" .ProgramChart}}</div></div><p class="paper-source">Accepted, non-archived talks, keynotes, workshops and panels. Counts describe the published program, not confirmed delivery. Each session is counted once even if it has multiple recordings.</p><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Technical exchange</span></footer></section>
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>05 / The hackathons</span><span>From ideas to prototypes</span></div><h2>Built here.<br><em>Worth following.</em></h2><div data-section="building"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.Section "building").Markdown}}</div></div><div class="annual-two"><div><h3>Submitted projects</h3>{{template "annual_bars" .ProjectChart}}</div><div><h3>Project members by event</h3>{{template "annual_bars" .ParticipantChart}}</div></div><p class="paper-source">{{.UniqueParticipants}} distinct project members across {{.HackCoverageCount}} events with reviewed database coverage. Multiple projects can share members; projects are not necessarily distinct teams.</p><table class="annual-table"><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Winning projects</th><th>Sponsor challenges</th><th>Sats sent / claimed</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{range .Included}}<tr><th>{{.Event.Location}}</th>{{if .HackKnown}}<td>{{.Winners}}</td><td>{{.Challenges}}</td><td>{{.SatsDisplay}}</td>{{else}}<td colspan="3">{{if eq .HackCoverage "none"}}No hackathon{{else}}Data not yet reconciled{{end}}</td>{{end}}</tr>{{end}}</tbody></table><p class="paper-source">Winning projects require finalized results. Payout totals are recorded sent/claimed distributions, not announced prize pools. Unreconciled events are excluded from hackathon totals and charts.</p><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Building</span></footer></section>
{{range .Included}}{{if and .HackKnown .WinningProjects}}<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>Project notebook / {{.Event.Location}}</span><span>Finalized winners</span></div><h2>Work to<br><em>keep watching.</em></h2><div class="annual-projects">{{$tag := .Event.Tag}}{{range .WinningProjects}}<article><p class="paper-kicker">{{.Awards}}</p><h3>{{.Title}}</h3><p>{{.Description}}</p><a href="https://btcpp.dev/{{$tag}}/hackathon/projects/{{.ID}}">Project details ↗</a> {{if .GitHub}}<a href="{{.GitHub}}">Project repository ↗</a>{{end}}</article>{{end}}</div><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{$.Year}}</span><span>Project notebook</span></footer></section>{{end}}{{end}}
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>06 / Beyond the room</span><span>Annual online reach</span></div><h2>The conversation<br><em>keeps travelling.</em></h2><div data-section="reach"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.Section "reach").Markdown}}</div></div>{{range .Platforms}}<article class="annual-platform"><h3>{{.Name}}</h3>{{if .Ready}}<div class="annual-reach-metrics">{{range .Metrics}}{{if .Value}}<div><strong>{{.Display}}</strong><span>{{.Label}}</span></div>{{end}}{{end}}</div><p class="paper-source">{{.Period}} · Export {{.Date}}<br>Source: {{.Source}}<br>Coverage: {{.Coverage}}</p>{{else}}<p>Annual export not supplied. Event-level snapshots, when available, follow separately.</p>{{end}}</article>{{end}}<p class="paper-source">Views, impressions and watch time are different measures. External-source YouTube views are a subset of total YouTube views. No combined “unique reach” is inferred.</p><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Online reach</span></footer></section>
{{range .Included}}{{if .Reach}}<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>Reach notebook / {{.Event.Location}}</span><span>Event-specific evidence</span></div><h2>One gathering.<br><em>A longer life online.</em></h2>{{range .Reach}}<article class="annual-platform"><h3>{{.Name}}</h3><div class="annual-reach-metrics">{{range .Metrics}}{{if .Value}}<div><strong>{{.Display}}</strong><span>{{.Label}}</span></div>{{end}}{{end}}</div><p class="paper-source">{{.Period}} · Export {{.Date}}<br>Source: {{.Source}}<br>Coverage: {{.Coverage}}</p></article>{{end}}<p class="paper-source">This dated event snapshot is not an annual account total. Different export periods are not added together.</p><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{$.Year}}</span><span>Event reach notebook</span></footer></section>{{end}}{{end}}
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>07 / Learning as we grow</span><span>What comes next</span></div><h2>Keep the ambition.<br><em>Learn from the friction.</em></h2><div data-section="lessons"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.Section "lessons").Markdown}}</div></div><h3>Where we go next</h3><div data-section="next"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.Section "next").Markdown}}</div></div>{{if .Upcoming}}<h3>Not included in this edition’s totals</h3><ul>{{range .Upcoming}}<li>{{.Event.Location}} · {{.Event.Period}}</li>{{end}}</ul>{{end}}<footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Thank you, {{.Recipient}}</span></footer></section>
<section class="paper-sheet"><div class="paper-running"><span>08 / Sources &amp; definitions</span><span>A clear account</span></div><h2>The evidence<br><em>behind the story.</em></h2><dl class="annual-methodology"><dt>Scope and collection time</dt><dd>Published events starting in {{.Year}}, completed by {{.Cutoff}} in each event’s local timezone, and selected by the editor. Figures collected {{.Generated}}. The cutoff selects events; it does not reconstruct historical values. {{if .Frozen}}This edition’s text and figures are frozen.{{else}}This is a live draft; figures may change.{{end}}</dd><dt>Registrations and attendance</dt><dd>Check-ins count distinct identities per event, excluding revoked registrations and preserving historical attendance after account deletion. Annual unique counts use linked person identities, falling back to email. Daily attendance is not collected. Unrecorded check-ins cannot be inferred.</dd><dt>Program and speakers</dt><dd>Accepted, non-archived program entries; talks include keynotes. Speakers are deduplicated across programs by profile identity. These are program records, not proof of delivery or attendance.</dd><dt>Hackathon coverage</dt><dd>The editor identifies events with reconciled database coverage and events without a hackathon. Missing external results remain unknown. Projects count submitted/advanced entries; participants count distinct project members. Winners require finalized results. Sats are sent/claimed distribution records, shown in k or M where appropriate, not independently verified settlement.</dd><dt>Online reach</dt><dd>Each platform export has its own source, period, date and content coverage. Blank means unavailable. Event exports are not automatically summed because their periods and selection may overlap.</dd><dt>Interpretation</dt><dd>These events offer a window into the Bitcoin development community, not a representative census. Project submissions do not establish adoption, sustained contribution or longer-term impact.</dd></dl><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Prepared for {{.Recipient}}</span></footer></section>
</div></main></body></html>
{{define "annual_bars"}}<div class="annual-bars">{{range .Rows}}<div class="annual-bar-row"><div><span>{{.Label}}</span><strong>{{.Value}}</strong></div><div class="annual-bar-track"><i style="width:{{.Width}}%"></i></div></div>{{else}}<p>No reviewed event data in this selection.</p>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
{{define "annual_donut"}}{{if .Donut}}<svg class="annual-donut" viewBox="0 0 120 120" role="img" aria-label="Distribution; values listed below"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="44" fill="none" stroke="#e1dae6" stroke-width="15"/>{{range .Donut}}<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="44" fill="none" stroke="{{.Color}}" stroke-width="15" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="{{.Percent}} 100" stroke-dashoffset="{{.Offset}}" transform="rotate(-90 60 60)"/>{{end}}<text x="60" y="65" text-anchor="middle">{{.DonutTotal}}</text></svg><ul class="annual-legend">{{range .Donut}}<li><i style="background:{{.Color}}"></i><span>{{.Label}}</span><strong>{{.Value}}</strong></li>{{end}}</ul>{{else}}<p>No recorded entries in this selection.</p>{{end}}{{end}}
